* ''The test harness ideas rest until the Lararium stands'' (operator, to Lares-Awakens, 2026-11-06/07: //"Set the test harness ideas down, we'll dogfood those into the Lararium once it stands."//). New test-harness ideas wait for the standing Lararium and enter it by dogfooding, beside `L30`; before standing, the harness takes only the cures a lane's work needs.

